Package: EconR
Type: Package
Title: Consistent Econometric Models with Model-Specific Missing-Data Handling
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: person('David', 'Bustamante', role = c('aut','cre'), email = 'davidbustamantelazo@gmail.com')
Description: Provides a consistent interface for econometric estimation with model-specific missing-data handling. Implements ordinary and weighted least squares (OLS/WLS), binary Logit and Probit, ordered Logit and Probit, and multinomial Logit and Probit regression models. Supports fixed and estimated error covariance specifications for multinomial Probit, classical, heteroskedasticity-consistent, and cluster-robust covariance estimation, observation weights, subsetting, and standard methods for statistical inference, prediction, diagnostics, marginal effects, and model augmentation.
